# Normalise every text file to LF, in the repository and in working copies.
#
# Not cosmetic for a plugin. `ovynt:plugin-sign` signs a SHA-256 digest of every file's
# contents, so if git hands a Windows checkout CRLF and a Linux checkout LF, the same
# commit produces two different digests — and a package signed on one machine fails
# verification after being cloned on the other. Pinning the line ending is what makes the
# signature reproducible from source.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.pem binary
plugin.sig binary
